            "text": "Motor Inn Auto Group sells used cars, trucks and SUVs at 1526 Le Clark Road in Carroll, Iowa, just off West US Highway 30. The used inventory includes more brands than Toyota and Chevrolet, depending on trade-ins. The live used inventory search on motorinnautogroup.com shows what is on the lot today."
